    # Single evaluation using the SFC3 paper's own Johnson Cook damage
    # constants (D1=0.04, D2=2.5, D3=3 -- Behzadinasab & Foster 2019) with
    # our own calibrated HE_0 Voce hardening. Not an optimization -- a
    # one-off diagnostic forward solve to see whether the paper's D1/D2/D3
    # alone produce smoother post-fracture softening than our own calibrated
